---
import resourceManifest from "../data/resources.json";
import subjectCatalog from "../data/subjects.json";

interface Props {
  subject: string;
  name: string;
  headline: string;
  description: string;
  icon: string;
}

const { subject, name, headline, description, icon } = Astro.props;
const subjectInfo = subjectCatalog.find((entry) => entry.slug === subject);
if (!subjectInfo) throw new Error(`Unknown Study Hub subject: ${subject}`);
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/")
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL
  : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
const libraryId = `${subject}-library`;
const subjectSlugs = [subject, subjectInfo.storageFolder, ...subjectInfo.folderAliases];
const allResources = resourceManifest.items.filter((item) => subjectSlugs.includes(item.subject));
const notes = allResources.filter((item) => item.category === "notes" || item.resourceType === "notes" || item.resourceType === "guide");
const papers = allResources.filter((item) => item.category === "papers" || item.resourceType === "paper");
const levels = new Set(allResources.map((item) => item.level).filter(Boolean));
---

<main class="subject-dashboard" data-subject={subject}>
  <section class="dashboard-hero">
    <div class="dashboard-welcome">
      <p class="dashboard-eyebrow">Study Hub · {name}</p>
      <h1>{headline}</h1>
      <p>{description}</p>
      <div class="dashboard-hero-actions">
        <a class="dashboard-primary" href={`#${libraryId}`}>Explore {name} resources <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <span class="dashboard-public-note">Free resources, open to everyone</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="dashboard-subject-mark" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>{icon}</span>
      <small>{name.toUpperCase()}</small>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dashboard-stats" aria-label={`${name} library statistics`}>
    <div class="dashboard-stat">
      <span class="dashboard-stat-icon">▤</span>
      <div><strong data-dashboard-stat="resources">{allResources.length}</strong><span>Resources</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="dashboard-stat">
      <span class="dashboard-stat-icon">✎</span>
      <div><strong data-dashboard-stat="notes">{notes.length}</strong><span>Notes &amp; guides</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="dashboard-stat">
      <span class="dashboard-stat-icon">✓</span>
      <div><strong data-dashboard-stat="papers">{papers.length}</strong><span>Past papers</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="dashboard-stat">
      <span class="dashboard-stat-icon">⌂</span>
      <div><strong data-dashboard-stat="levels">{levels.size}</strong><span>Study levels</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dashboard-section curriculum-overview" aria-labelledby={`${subject}-curriculum-heading`}>
    <div class="dashboard-section-heading">
      <div><p class="dashboard-eyebrow">UNEB / NCDC curriculum</p><h2 id={`${subject}-curriculum-heading`}>Subject overview</h2></div>
    </div>
    <div class="curriculum-details">
      <p><strong>Study levels</strong><span>{subjectInfo.levels.join(" · ")}</span></p>
      <p><strong>Curriculum track</strong><span>{subjectInfo.tracks.join(" · ")}</span></p>
      {subjectInfo.codes.length > 0 && (
        <p><strong>UNEB subject code</strong><span>{subjectInfo.codes.map(({ level, code }) => `${level}: ${code}`).join(" · ")}</span></p>
      )}
      <p class="curriculum-note">Resources are added as they become available. Check back for notes and exam papers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dashboard-section dashboard-learning-path" aria-labelledby={`${subject}-learning-heading`}>
    <div class="dashboard-section-heading">
      <div><p class="dashboard-eyebrow">A practical way to learn</p><h2 id={`${subject}-learning-heading`}>Turn {name} study into steady progress</h2></div>
    </div>
    <div class="dashboard-learning-copy">
      <p>Strong understanding grows in stages. Start by looking over the {subjectInfo.levels.join(" and ")} topics and noting what you already know, what needs another explanation, and which ideas connect to one another. In {name}, this is especially useful when working through {subjectInfo.focus.toLowerCase()}: pause to explain each idea in your own words instead of moving on as soon as a page is finished.</p>
      <p>Use a set of notes to build a clear picture of one topic at a time. Read actively, mark unfamiliar terms, and turn headings, diagrams, or worked examples into questions you can answer without looking. When an explanation is difficult, return to its earlier steps and identify the exact point where your understanding breaks down. Small, specific questions are easier to solve than trying to reread an entire book from the beginning.</p>
      <p>Once the main ideas make sense, practise applying them. Attempt questions before checking a solution, show your working where relevant, and keep a short record of mistakes or topics to revisit. Past papers help you practise interpreting exam questions and managing a complete task; they work best after you have built some understanding, not as a substitute for it.</p>
      <p>Study Hub brings the reading and practice stages together. Browse the latest additions for new material, search the notes for a topic or year, and use the past-paper collection to test your progress. Choose a manageable task, finish it carefully, then return to the next topic with a clearer sense of what to do.</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="dashboard-learning-links" aria-label={`${name} study links`}>
      <a class="toggle-btn" href="#notes-content" data-target="notes-content" data-dashboard-jump="notes-content" aria-controls="notes-content" aria-expanded="false">Start with study notes <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      <a class="toggle-btn" href="#papers-content" data-target="papers-content" data-dashboard-jump="papers-content" aria-controls="papers-content" aria-expanded="false">Practise with past papers <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      <a href="#recently-added">See what was added recently <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
    </nav>
  </section>

  <section class="dashboard-resource-search" aria-labelledby={`${subject}-search-heading`}
    data-dashboard-library
    data-dashboard-subject={subject}
    data-dashboard-aliases={subjectSlugs.join(",")}
    data-dashboard-reader={`${base}full_page_flipbook_viewer/index.html`}
    data-dashboard-return={`${base}frontend/src/html/${subject}.html`}
  >
    <div class="dashboard-section-heading">
      <div><p class="dashboard-eyebrow">Find the right resource</p><h2 id={`${subject}-search-heading`}>Search the {name} collection</h2></div>
      <span class="dashboard-library-total" data-dashboard-total>{allResources.length} resources</span>
    </div>
    <div class="dashboard-search-controls">
      <label>
        <span>Search by topic, title, level, or year</span>
        <input type="search" data-dashboard-query placeholder={`Try a topic, title, ${name}, or year…`} autocomplete="off">
      </label>
      <label>
        <span>Study level</span>
        <select data-dashboard-level><option value="">All levels</option></select>
      </label>
      <label>
        <span>Year</span>
        <select data-dashboard-year><option value="">All years</option></select>
      </label>
    </div>
    <p class="dashboard-search-status" data-dashboard-status aria-live="polite">Loading the resource index…</p>
  </section>

  <section class="dashboard-section dashboard-resource-section" id="recently-added" aria-labelledby={`${subject}-recent-heading`}
    data-dashboard-collection="recent"
    data-dashboard-parent={subject}
  >
    <div class="dashboard-section-heading">
      <div><p class="dashboard-eyebrow">Fresh from the library</p><h2 id={`${subject}-recent-heading`}>Recently added</h2></div>
      <a href={`#${libraryId}`}>Open full library <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="dashboard-resource-rows" data-dashboard-rows="recent" aria-label={`Recently added ${name} resources`}>
      {[0, 1].map((row) => (
        <div class="dashboard-resource-row-wrap">
          <button class="dashboard-row-control" type="button" data-dashboard-scroll="recent" data-row={row} data-direction="-1" aria-label={`Scroll recently added row ${row + 1} left`}>←</button>
          <div class="dashboard-resource-row" data-dashboard-row="recent" data-row={row} tabindex="0" aria-label={`Recently added ${name} resources, row ${row + 1}`}></div>
          <button class="dashboard-row-control" type="button" data-dashboard-scroll="recent" data-row={row} data-direction="1" aria-label={`Scroll recently added row ${row + 1} right`}>→</button>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="dashboard-collection-status" data-dashboard-collection-status="recent" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </section>

  <section class="dashboard-section dashboard-resource-section" aria-labelledby={`${subject}-notes-heading`}
    data-dashboard-collection="notes"
    data-dashboard-parent={subject}
  >
    <div class="dashboard-section-heading">
      <div><p class="dashboard-eyebrow">Read, understand, recall</p><h2 id={`${subject}-notes-heading`}>Study notes and guides</h2></div>
      <a class="toggle-btn" href="#notes-content" data-target="notes-content" data-dashboard-jump="notes-content" aria-controls="notes-content" aria-expanded="false">Open notes collection <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="dashboard-resource-rows" data-dashboard-rows="notes" aria-label={`${name} notes and study guides`}>
      {[0, 1].map((row) => (
        <div class="dashboard-resource-row-wrap">
          <button class="dashboard-row-control" type="button" data-dashboard-scroll="notes" data-row={row} data-direction="-1" aria-label={`Scroll study notes row ${row + 1} left`}>←</button>
          <div class="dashboard-resource-row" data-dashboard-row="notes" data-row={row} tabindex="0" aria-label={`${name} notes, row ${row + 1}`}></div>
          <button class="dashboard-row-control" type="button" data-dashboard-scroll="notes" data-row={row} data-direction="1" aria-label={`Scroll study notes row ${row + 1} right`}>→</button>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="dashboard-collection-status" data-dashboard-collection-status="notes" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </section>
</main>

<script is:inline src={`${base}scripts/dashboard-previews.js`} defer></script>
<script>
  document.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
    const link = (event.target as HTMLElement).closest<HTMLAnchorElement>("[data-dashboard-jump]");
    if (!link) return;

    const targetId = link.dataset.dashboardJump;
    const panel = targetId ? document.getElementById(targetId) : null;
    if (!panel) return;

    event.preventDefault();
    event.stopImmediatePropagation();
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(".resource-content").forEach((candidate) => {
      const isTarget = candidate === panel;
      candidate.style.display = isTarget ? "block" : "none";
      candidate.classList.toggle("expanded", isTarget);
      if (candidate.id) {
        document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(`[aria-controls="${candidate.id}"]`).forEach((control) => {
          control.setAttribute("aria-expanded", String(isTarget && control === link));
        });
      }
    });
    history.replaceState(null, "", `#${targetId}`);
    panel.scrollIntoView({ behavior: window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches ? "auto" : "smooth" });
  }, true);
</script>

<style>
  .subject-dashboard {
    --dashboard-accent: #28634f;
    --dashboard-accent-soft: #e8f2eb;
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 28px auto 20px;
    padding: 0 28px;
    color: #192b3b;
    font-family: "DM Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .subject-dashboard[data-subject="chemistry"] { --dashboard-accent: #94621c; --dashboard-accent-soft: #fff3dc; }
  .subject-dashboard[data-subject="mathematics"] { --dashboard-accent: #315c91; --dashboard-accent-soft: #eaf1fb; }
  .subject-dashboard[data-subject="physics"] { --dashboard-accent: #286d7a; --dashboard-accent-soft: #e5f3f4; }
  .dashboard-hero {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    min-height: 240px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 38px clamp(24px, 5vw, 58px);
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,.13), transparent 26%), linear-gradient(125deg, #102a42, #1c4058);
    color: white;
  }
  .dashboard-welcome { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 680px; }
  .dashboard-eyebrow { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--dashboard-accent); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .dashboard-hero .dashboard-eyebrow { color: #b8daca; }
  .dashboard-hero h1 { max-width: 660px; margin: 0; color: #fff; font-family: Manrope, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.2vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1.08; }
  .dashboard-hero p:not(.dashboard-eyebrow) { max-width: 620px; margin: 14px 0 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,.77); }
  .dashboard-hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-top: 22px; }
  .dashboard-primary { display: inline-flex; min-height: 44px; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 0 17px; border-radius: 7px; background: #f0b642; color: #1b2d3d; font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; }
  .dashboard-primary:hover { background: #ffca62; }
  .dashboard-public-note { color: rgba(255,255,255,.68); font-size: .82rem; }
  .dashboard-subject-mark { display: grid; width: 150px; height: 150px; flex: 0 0 auto; align-content: center; justify-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-left: 30px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); }
  .dashboard-subject-mark span { font-size: 3.8rem; line-height: 1; }
  .dashboard-subject-mark small { color: #c6d6df; font-size: .65rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .16em; }
  .dashboard-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin: 17px 0; }
  .dashboard-stat { display: flex; min-height: 80px; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 14px 17px; border: 1px solid #e0e6e9; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff; }
  .dashboard-stat-icon { display: grid; width: 40px; height: 40px; flex: 0 0 auto; place-items: center; border-radius: 11px; background: var(--dashboard-accent-soft); color: var(--dashboard-accent); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; }
  .dashboard-stat div { display: grid; gap: 1px; }
  .dashboard-stat strong { font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.2; }
  .dashboard-stat div span { color: #657483; font-size: .78rem; }
  .dashboard-section { margin: 28px 0; }
  .curriculum-overview { padding: 20px 22px; border: 1px solid #e0e6e9; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff; }
  .curriculum-overview .dashboard-section-heading { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .curriculum-details { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 28px; }
  .curriculum-details > p { display: grid; gap: 2px; margin: 0; color: #657483; font-size: .82rem; }
  .curriculum-details strong { color: #213448; font-size: .76rem; }
  .curriculum-details code { color: var(--dashboard-accent); font-size: .82rem; }
  .curriculum-details .curriculum-note { flex-basis: 100%; margin-top: 4px; }
  .dashboard-learning-path { padding: 22px; border: 1px solid #e0e6e9; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff; }
  .dashboard-learning-copy { display: grid; max-width: 920px; gap: 14px; color: #4f5f6c; font-size: .93rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  .dashboard-learning-copy p { margin: 0; }
  .dashboard-learning-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 20px; margin-top: 18px; }
  .dashboard-learning-links a { color: var(--dashboard-accent); font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; }
  .dashboard-learning-links a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .dashboard-section-heading { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .dashboard-section-heading .dashboard-eyebrow { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .dashboard-section-heading h2 { margin: 0; font-family: Manrope, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2vw, 1.7rem); }
  .dashboard-section-heading > a, .dashboard-text-button { padding: 0; border: 0; background: none; color: var(--dashboard-accent); font: inherit; font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; cursor: pointer; }
  .dashboard-section-heading > a:hover, .dashboard-text-button:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .dashboard-library-total, .dashboard-search-status, .dashboard-collection-status { color: #657483; font-size: .78rem; }
  .dashboard-search-controls { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, 2fr) repeat(2, minmax(140px, .8fr)); gap: 12px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid #dfe6e2; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff; }
  .dashboard-search-controls label { display: grid; gap: 6px; color: #435465; font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .dashboard-search-controls input, .dashboard-search-controls select { width: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 44px; padding: 8px 11px; border: 1px solid #cbd5d1; border-radius: 7px; background: #fff; color: #213448; font: inherit; font-size: .88rem; }
  .dashboard-search-controls input:focus-visible, .dashboard-search-controls select:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--dashboard-accent) 28%, transparent); border-color: var(--dashboard-accent); }
  .dashboard-search-status { margin: 8px 2px 0; }
  :global(.dashboard-retry) { min-height: 32px; margin-left: 8px; padding: 4px 10px; border: 1px solid #cbd5d1; border-radius: 6px; background: #fff; color: #24394c; font: inherit; font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
  :global(.dashboard-retry:hover) { border-color: var(--dashboard-accent); color: var(--dashboard-accent); }
  .dashboard-resource-section { scroll-margin-top: 24px; }
  .dashboard-resource-rows { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .dashboard-resource-row-wrap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 36px minmax(0, 1fr) 36px; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .dashboard-row-control { display: grid; width: 36px; height: 36px; min-height: 36px !important; place-items: center; padding: 0 !important; border: 1px solid #cbd5d1 !important; border-radius: 50% !important; background: #fff !important; color: #24394c !important; font: inherit !important; cursor: pointer; }
  .dashboard-row-control:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--dashboard-accent) !important; color: var(--dashboard-accent) !important; }
  .dashboard-row-control:disabled { opacity: .45; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .dashboard-resource-row { display: flex; min-width: 0; gap: 12px; overflow-x: auto; padding: 4px 2px 10px; scroll-snap-type: x proximity; overscroll-behavior-inline: contain; scrollbar-color: #9aa9a2 #e9eeeb; scrollbar-width: thin; touch-action: pan-x; }
  .dashboard-resource-row:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--dashboard-accent) 45%, transparent); outline-offset: 2px; }
  :global(.dashboard-resource-card) { display: flex; width: 220px; min-width: 220px; min-height: 170px; flex: 0 0 220px; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e0e6e9; border-radius: 11px; background: #fff; color: #213448; text-decoration: none; scroll-snap-align: start; transition: border-color .15s, transform .15s, box-shadow .15s; }
  :global(.dashboard-resource-card:hover) { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: var(--dashboard-accent); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(25,43,59,.08); }
  :global(.dashboard-preview) { position: relative; display: grid; width: 100%; height: 96px; flex: 0 0 96px; place-items: center; overflow: hidden; background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--dashboard-accent-soft), #f5f7f7); }
  :global(.dashboard-preview canvas) { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%; object-fit: contain; opacity: 0; transition: opacity .2s; }
  :global(.dashboard-preview-image) { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
  :global(.dashboard-preview-document) { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 50%; width: 816px; height: 1056px; overflow: hidden; transform-origin: top center; pointer-events: none; }
  :global(.dashboard-preview-document .docx-wrapper) { width: 816px !important; margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; background: white !important; }
  :global(.dashboard-preview-document .docx-wrapper > section.docx) { width: 816px !important; min-height: 1056px !important; margin: 0 !important; padding: 40px !important; box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(.dashboard-preview.has-preview canvas) { opacity: 1; }
  :global(.dashboard-preview.has-preview .dashboard-preview-placeholder),
  :global(.dashboard-preview.has-preview .dashboard-preview-caption) { display: none; }
  :global(.dashboard-preview-placeholder) { color: var(--dashboard-accent); font-size: 2rem; }
  :global(.dashboard-preview-caption) { position: absolute; right: 6px; bottom: 5px; left: 6px; overflow: hidden; color: #526273; font-size: .62rem; text-align: center; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  :global(.dashboard-resource-type) { display: flex; min-height: 72px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 9px; background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--dashboard-accent-soft), #f5f7f7); color: var(--dashboard-accent); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  :global(.dashboard-resource-type span:first-child) { font-size: 1.65rem; }
  :global(.dashboard-resource-copy) { display: flex; min-width: 0; flex: 1; flex-direction: column; padding: 10px 12px; }
  :global(.dashboard-card-title) { display: -webkit-box; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; font-size: .83rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; overflow-wrap: anywhere; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; }
  :global(.dashboard-card-meta) { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 7px; color: #526273; font-size: .7rem; }
  .dashboard-collection-status { margin: 5px 2px 0; }
  :global(.dashboard-resource-empty) { padding: 18px; border: 1px dashed #cbd5d1; border-radius: 10px; color: #526273; font-size: .86rem; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .subject-dashboard { margin-top: 16px; padding: 0 16px; }
    .dashboard-hero { min-height: 215px; padding: 28px 24px; }
    .dashboard-subject-mark { width: 92px; height: 92px; margin-left: 12px; }
    .dashboard-subject-mark span { font-size: 2.6rem; }
    .dashboard-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .dashboard-search-controls { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .dashboard-search-controls label:first-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .dashboard-hero { align-items: flex-start; padding: 24px 18px; }
    .dashboard-subject-mark { width: 56px; height: 56px; border: 0; background: transparent; }
    .dashboard-subject-mark span { font-size: 2rem; }
    .dashboard-subject-mark small { display: none; }
    .dashboard-hero-actions { gap: 10px; }
    .dashboard-public-note { width: 100%; }
    .dashboard-stats { gap: 8px; }
    .dashboard-stat { min-height: 70px; gap: 9px; padding: 10px; }
    .dashboard-stat-icon { width: 34px; height: 34px; }
    .dashboard-stat strong { font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .dashboard-stat div span { font-size: .7rem; }
    .dashboard-section-heading { align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .dashboard-search-controls { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 12px; }
    .dashboard-search-controls label:first-child { grid-column: auto; }
    .dashboard-resource-row-wrap { grid-template-columns: 30px minmax(0, 1fr) 30px; gap: 4px; }
    .dashboard-row-control { width: 30px; height: 30px; min-height: 30px !important; }
    :global(.dashboard-resource-card) { width: min(70vw, 220px); min-width: min(70vw, 220px); flex-basis: min(70vw, 220px); }
